# Public read URL for the R2 bucket's built race JSON (a CDN/custom domain or
# the r2.dev public bucket URL — never the S3 write credentials from the
# pipeline's .env, those must never ship to the browser).
VITE_DATA_BASE_URL=https://pub-2c102fc0a8114f89a7afbe75818e841f.r2.dev

# Mapbox public token for the address-autocomplete dropdown (Search Box API).
# Meant to ship in client-side code per Mapbox's own model — restrict it to
# ballot-wise.com/*.pages.dev in the Mapbox account's token settings rather
# than trying to keep it secret. Optional: the input just behaves as a plain
# text field with no suggestions if this is unset.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# PayPal CLIENT ID (not the secret) for the Contribute button's Smart
# Payment Buttons — meant to ship in client-side code per PayPal's own
# model, same as the Mapbox token above. Get this from
# developer.paypal.com -> Apps & Credentials, after creating a PayPal
# Business account and linking a bank account (the account creation and
# bank linking has to happen directly on PayPal's site — nothing here can
# do that step). Use a Sandbox app's client ID first to test the flow with
# fake money, then switch to a Live app's client ID to accept real
# contributions. Optional: the Contribute modal shows a plain "not open
# yet" message instead of a broken button if this is unset.
VITE_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=
